{'symbol': 'IR', 'date': '2023-05-31 07:30:00', 'title': 'INGERSOLL RAND RECEIVES UPGRADE FROM MORNINGSTAR SUSTAINALYTICS', 'text': 'DAVIDSON, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INGERSOLL RAND INC. (NYSE:IR), A GLOBAL PROVIDER OF MISSION-CRITICAL FLOW CREATION AND INDUSTRIAL SOLUTIONS, HAD ITS RISK RATING UPGRADED FROM MEDIUM TO LOW BY MORNINGSTAR SUSTAINALYTICS. IN APRIL 2023, INGERSOLL RAND RECEIVED AN ESG RISK RATING OF 12.8 FROM MORNINGSTAR SUSTAINALYTICS, RANKING IT SECOND IN THE MACHINERY INDUSTRY GROUP, WHICH PLACES IT IN THE 1ST PERCENTILE FOR ITS INDUSTRY. THIS RISK RATING ALSO PLACES INGERSOLL RAND IN THE 6TH PERCENTILE OF ALL.'}